Add IDMap for fast identifier lookup.

This is a first step towards speeding up cell+cluster reconstruction,
which for the Allegro Ecal barrel is very slow when all cells
are present (when noise is added, for example).  A lot of the time is spent
in looking up identifiers in maps.  As a step towards speeding this up,
we introduce a trie-based data structure that is significantly faster
than unordered_map for identifier lookups.  Upcoming changes will make use
of this to actually speed up the reconstruction.
